[8170]="The Battle for Arathi Basin!\031As you no doubt have heard, the League of Arathor is sending large numbers of troops into Arathi Basin.  Eager for food and supplies, these Alliance fools are intent to take and control the rich resources there.  We must show them that Arathi will never again be a home for humans!$B$BGo to Arathi Basin and assault the mine, the lumber mill, the blacksmith and the stables.  Pull down the enemies' banners, declaring those territories for the Horde.$B$BGo, $N.  Report back to me when this task is complete.\031Assault the Arathi Basin mine, lumber mill, blacksmith and stable, and then return to Deathmaster Dwire in Hammerfall.\031\031\031\031Mine Assaulted\031Lumber Mill Assaulted\031Blacksmith Assaulted\031Stable Assaulted",
[8171]="The Battle for Arathi Basin!\031As you no doubt have heard, the League of Arathor is sending large numbers of troops into Arathi Basin.  Eager for food and supplies, these Alliance fools are intent to take and control the rich resources there.  We must show them that Arathi will never again be a home for humans!$B$BGo to Arathi Basin and assault the mine, the lumber mill, the blacksmith and the stables.  Pull down the enemies' banners, declaring those territories for the Horde.$B$BGo, $N.  Report back to me when this task is complete.\031Assault the Arathi Basin mine, lumber mill, blacksmith and stable, and then return to Deathmaster Dwire in Hammerfall.\031\031\031\031Mine Assaulted\031Lumber Mill Assaulted\031Blacksmith Assaulted\031Stable Assaulted",
[8181]="Confront Yeh'kinya\031My delvings into the Mosh'aru Tablets bear grim news, $N.  Hakkar's true form, the god himself, can be born again through the very egg into which you captured him.  Yeh'kinya told you it was to contain his evil, but it is to recreate it!  The troll has led you astray!$B$BGo to Yeh'kinya and demand the egg from him.  Pray that it is not too late to stop Hakkar's return!\031Speak with Yeh'kinya.\031So, you have been speaking with that old dwarf Ironboot and uncovered the lost Mosh'aru Tablets, have you?  That meddling prospector...$B$BNo matter.  It is too late to save this world.  Hakkar has been reborn, and even now grows in power... deep in the ancient troll kingdom of Zul'Gurub!  He has come!  And he will rule in blood and terror!$B$BThank you, $N.  Your help has sped the return of the Soulflayer!",
[8182]="The Hand of Rastakhan\031$N, our worst fears have come.  Legend speaks of the Soulflayer ruling the ancient troll world through evil and terror, and his power was absolute.  If he cannot be stopped now, then his new reign may spread across all of Azeroth!$B$BThere is a contingent of Zandalarian trolls who may help us stem this tide of darkness.  They have camped on Yojamba Isle, off the coast of Stranglethorn, west of the ruins of Zul'Kunda.  Speak with their leader, Molthor, and pray he knows how to defeat Hakkar.\031Speak with Molthor in Stranglethorn.\031You were sent by the prospector, Ironboot?  His kind are wise, and wiser still to bring you to me, for I and the Zandalarian trolls may know a way to defeat the Soulflayer.$B$BSpeak with the trolls of this isle, heed their words, and prepare yourself, $N, for the task before you is soaked in blood.",
[8183]="The Heart of Hakkar\031The Heart of Hakkar burns from within.  Although the Soulflayer is defeated, the kernel of his power yet remains in this cursed organ.\031Bring the Heart of Hakkar to Molthor on Yojamba Isle.\031Ah, the Heart of Hakkar.  So the Soulflayer has been slain!  Our world is saved!$B$B$N, your service to us cannot be overstated.  You truly are a hero of this realm!\031$N, the reek of an evil soul surrounds you.  Have you been cursed by the Soulflayer?",
[8184]="Presence of Might\031Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. $BThe first is a primal Hakkari idol that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin'do and the Bloodlord.$BThe second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter $B$Bthis foul place. Look inside the jinxed hoodoo. Bring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!\031Bring me thise things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you! $BPrimal Hakkari Idol$BPunctured Voodoo Doll\031Use it well, $C. Show the Hakkari no mercy!\031Bring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!",
[8185]="Syncretist's Sigil\031Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. The first is a primal Hakkari idol that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin'do and the Bloodlord.$B$BThe second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter this foul place. Look inside the jinxed hoodoo.$B$BBring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!\031Bring me thise things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you! $BPrimal Hakkari Idol$BPunctured Voodoo Doll\031Use it well, $C. Show the Hakkari no mercy!\031Bring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!",
