[8935]="Just Compensation\031You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux.  I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin.  Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade.  I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.\031Bring a Shadowcraft Belt and a set of Shadowcraft Gloves to Deliana in Ironforge.\031You've kept your end of the bargain, I shall keep mine.$B$BJust remember that I'm holding on to the best pieces until your work is finished.\031You're ready to perform the trade?",
[8936]="Just Compensation\031You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux.  I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin.  Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade.  I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.\031Bring a Dreadmist Belt and a set of Dreadmist Wraps to Deliana in Ironforge.\031You've kept your end of the bargain, I shall keep mine.$B$BJust remember that I'm holding on to the best pieces until your work is finished.\031You're ready to perform the trade?",
[8937]="Just Compensation\031You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux.  I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin.  Bring me the belt and set of gauntlets that you wish to upgrade.  I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.\031Bring a Belt of Valor and a set of Gauntlets of Valor to Deliana in Ironforge.\031You've kept your end of the bargain, I shall keep mine.$B$BJust remember that I'm holding on to the best pieces until your work is finished.\031You're ready to perform the trade?",
[8938]="Just Compensation\031You've proven to be a very reliable individual, $N.  As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.$B$BFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves.  If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.\031Bring a Beaststalker's Belt and a set of Beaststalker's Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.\031Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power.\031You're ready to perform the exchange?",
[8939]="Just Compensation\031You've proven to be a very reliable individual, $N.  As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.$B$BFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves.  If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.\031Bring a Magister's Belt and a set of Magister's Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.\031Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power.\031You're ready to perform the exchange?",
