[9061]="Cryptstalker Wristguards\031I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.$B$BBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!\031Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.\031Exellent $N !$B , you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Wristguards.\031You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",
[9062]="Soaked Pages\031Those blasted Wretched sure can run fast at the sight of someone who'll stand up to them.  But let's not worry about that now.  I need to find my instructor's elemental grimoire.$B$BI'm certain I saw one of those cowards throw it into the river but I cannot seem to be able to locate it.  I could use another set of eyes.  I'll throw in a bit of coin if you spot it.\031Apprentice Meledor in Eversong Woods wants you to search the water beneath the bridge nearby and bring him Antheol's Elemental Grimoire.\031The book is completely soaked. Instructor Antheol's not going to like this at all.$B$BHere, take this money. I have an idea.\031No luck? Well, keep looking. The book is of utmost importance, $C.",
[9063]="Torwa Pathfinder\031A hunter by the name of Torwa Pathfinder has requested the help of a druid.  He said only we would possess the necessary skills and respect for nature to help him.$b$bThere is a road that connects the Un'Goro Crater and the desert of Tanaris.  As that road enters the crater, you will find Torwa close by.\031Speak with Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater.\031You have traveled far to meet with me, $C, and not a moment too soon.",
[9064]="Taking the Fall\031Antheol is going to fly off his rocker when he finds out his book is ruined.  I've got a little proposal for you; don't worry, I'll make it worth your while.$B$BTake this book to him and tell him nothing of this incident.  If he asks, just tell him you dropped the book into a puddle.  He has no direct authority over you, so there's not much he can do.$B$BAntheol delivers his lectures at Stillwhisper Pond, southeast of Silvermoon.  You'll do this for us, right?  I'll reward you handsomely for this favor!\031Bring Antheol's Elemental Grimoire to Instructor Antheol at Stillwhisper Pond in Eversong Woods.\031You say those two incompetent fools bribed you to lie to me? You've done very well in coming to me, $N.\031What calls for this interruption to my lecture, $C?",
[9065]="The \"Chow\" Quest (123)aa\031$Tpunk;!  Kill Kobold Vermin, 2 of em.\031Kill Kobold Vermin, 2 of em.",
[9066]="Swift Discipline\031I hope you learn a valuable lesson today, $N.  Never trust someone else to lie for you.$B$BNow I want you to go back to my two dimwitted students and discipline them using this wand.  My magic tells me that you'll find them along the road to the west on the other side of the Dead Scar.$B$BCome back to me after you've done this.  I'll give you a small reward for your troubles.\031Use Antheol's Disciplinary Rod on his two students: Apprentice Ralen and Apprentice Meledor.  Return to Antheol at Stillwhisper Pond in Eversong Woods with the rod after this.\031Excellent job, $N. Don't worry, they're not stuck in that form permanently.  Their apprenticeship, however, won't be restored until they earn it back.\031Did you do what I asked of you, $N?\031\031Apprentice Meledor Disciplined\031Apprentice Ralen Disciplined",
[9067]="The Party Never Ends\031I like to throw parties... just a little something to celebrate the magnificence that is Quel'Thalas!$B$BBut, I'm in a bit of a bind.  I need you to gather up more party supplies.$B$BFrom Vinemaster Suntouched at the Silvermoon City inn, bring me a bottle of Suntouched Special Reserve.  From Zalene Firstlight at Farstrider Retreat acquire more of those delicious Springpaw Appetizers.  And you can pick up my delivery of fireworks from Halis Dawnstrider at Fairbreeze Village.$B$BBe quick about it!\031Acquire a bottle of Suntouched Special Reserve, Springpaw Appetizers and a Bundle of Fireworks, and return them to Lord Saltheril at Saltheril's Haven in Eversong Woods.\031You're quite the energetic young woman, aren't you?$B$BThis all looks very adequate.  You certainly deserve compensation for gathering up all of this for me, and something a little extra I think.$B$BOh, I almost forgot, here's an invitation to the party.  And, $C, next time that you drop in make sure to dress up in something a little more... festive.\031Didn't I just send you out to gather up more party supplies?  Was that you?  Oh, I can't be expected to remember everyone's face, now can I?  I meet so many... interesting people.$B$BWhat is it that you want?",
[9068]="Earthshatter Tunic\031Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?$B$BThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.$B$BBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.$B$BSearch Naxxramas.\031Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.\031Exellent $N !$B , you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Tunic.\031You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",
